{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_mostma_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_mostma_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Atop the Skyscrapers",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_mostma_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9c4f112c9816eec2391d8136ff996622f0d055a0183c188361e9753eda0119a1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "个人剧情 莫斯提马"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aha, how many are you? Five, no, six, huh? I'm in a hurry, so just take me all at once!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the alleys of Lungmen, Exusiai is making deliveries in her own special way, as usual.\nWhat she doesn't know is that on a rooftop not far away, someone is watching her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rooftop_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tsk tsk, El is playful as ever, and her marksmanship continues to improve."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You think so too, right? Watching her makes me miss my gun."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get Rhodes Island to make a gun-staff? Perish the thought... If Lemuen saw, she'd make fun of me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Besides, wouldn't that look like I'm pining for the past?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm? I'm not that sentimental."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But it's not like I've forgotten either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Times change, and so do people. I thought you'd know that better than anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...That's true. You perceive things different from we do, huh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I do think about it sometimes. What does change feel like when you count time by the century?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can you find meaning in a subtle feeling at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I mean, you know it doesn't matter to me anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, so it was you, Mostima."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yith?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "G'day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Does Emperor need me for something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not really. There hasn't been anything major lately. I was just passing by when I felt a familiar aura."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And that's... Exusiai over there? I see, I see, just another day of work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's right. Also took the chance to take this little fella out for some fresh air and a little chat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, sounds like a good time. I'm jealous."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Same as always. No rest for the wicked."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You work too hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, please. It's what I was made for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "By the way, since you're here, I'd like to ask you a favor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've got a nasty complainer here lately. Might be something wrong with the lock. I was hoping you'd take a look for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, I thought the lock was looking a bit worn down when you gave it to me for safekeeping last Sauin. Wouldn't surprise me if there were some minor problems."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Pass it over then, I'll take care of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your other one's fine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure, it's in the lock. The other one's just the key. Won't give me any issues."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mostima pats the gray staff at her waist, then draws the brown staff out and hands it to Yith."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Old friend, we meet again."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Huh, looks like it's in a bad mood indeed, and doesn't want to talk to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Speaking of which, Mostima, I've never asked you this before, but I'm curious - where did you get this lock and key?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It was somewhere around Kazdel before it came into my hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Near Kazdel, huh... That explains a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can't say I expected that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you want more details, I mean, I could tell you the whole story. But I don't really feel like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The whole story... Are you talking about the Liberi girl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, you've met?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just once, last Sauin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Pain in the ass, isn't she?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yea..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "'Bang!' Suddenly, a crossbow bolt penetrates into the space between Mostima and Yith."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "See?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Seems like she's no fan of mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, she's just getting pissy at me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Really dig deep there. I joined Penguin Logistics because of you and Emperor, but we haven't had any serious talks since then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So hit me with any questions you got."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Have you considered looking for the other pieces?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is the only one left."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And even if it wasn't, it's not into the idea, and neither am I. Might as well leave things as they are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know though, if it really wasn't interested, it wouldn't have ended up like this in the first place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I see. That does make sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Much of the way we are now can be attributed to similar decisions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Actually, I've asked it before, whether it wanted to come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let me think... That's right, it was during the Rhodes Island operator test."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Umm... I guess because it seemed like an interesting place, so I wanted to show them what I could do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Might've also been because I wanted to scare the Doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This one wouldn't cooperate, though. It felt something, I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And hey, I gotta hand it to 'em, Rhodes Island is definitely interesting. You should check it out yourself, if you have the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, if I have the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And when might that be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who knows? Keep an eye on Emperor's mood. If it sours, I might have some time on my hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But meetings between people are wonderful things indeed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After its hibernation, it actually met a wielder so well suited to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But if I'm being real, it's brought me way more headaches than power."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But you don't mind, do you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Guess I don't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In any case, that's enough chatting for the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_035",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll let you know how the staff turns out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright. Bye bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's with the pissy face?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm honored."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who the hell was that? I know Emperor's got something crazy going on underneath, but I never knew Penguin Logistics had anyone like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You actually gave him your staff, and he seemed pretty comfortable with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's say it's his area of expertise and he's trustworthy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's say your trust and that crossbow bolt have a conversation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you need an explanation? I'm an open book."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No thanks... 'they' obviously know what's going on, and just decided not to tell me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And that means I shouldn't be hearing it from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And that doesn't bother you at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My job is to keep my eyes on your horns. Beyond that, it's none of my business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You don't care at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, hear me out. You volunteered to watch me, way back when, but there's a ton of stuff you have no way of knowing. And you're running yourself ragged to keep up with me. That's some serious masochism."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As if I need you to spell it all out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll say it again: what happened in Kazdel wasn't your fault."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whether you were there or not, I would've pulled the trigger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And you don't care that you've turned into this, I take it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bingo! See, you're getting to know me better and better."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And my choices are none of your business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure, sure— Oh yeah, some folks from the Notarial Hall swung by yesterday, right? Another new job?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not for the time being, just a routine report. But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh? Did they change your codename again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering?",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah... *Sigh*."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That bad, huh? Lay it on me, I could use some cheering up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suffering?",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...One-Armed Chainsaw Guy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh... Did they just watch that shitty Lungmen flick?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I brought it back. Ugh, I should've known better. Why didn't I bring them something artsy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah, hah, hah. Maybe you'll be Guns n' Roses next time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Better than One-Armed Chainsaw Guy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, let's go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I thought you were going to follow her around all day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do I look that bored to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you ask me, I'd say that there aren't many people in this world more bored than you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you really think so highly of me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That wasn't a compliment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What matters is that I take it as a compliment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Anyway, that really wasn't my plan. Just had to swing by to take a look, call it force of habit. Wouldn't be my first time doing this either, and you should know that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I do. That you're not proactively trying to make contact with her is a good thing in my opinion, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ever since I had that little chat with her last Sauin, you've been totally fixated on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you worried that I'll tell her something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If that was your plan, I might not be able to stop you. So I need to know how you feel about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm... Fine then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know that look in your eyes. You're not gonna leave until I give you an answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm glad you understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Force speaks louder than reason with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tell me this... what's the best way to make someone stop caring about you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "To disappear from their life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, not good enough. Once you've appeared, there's no way to completely disappear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You have to wait for that person to find a new life, a new environment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "To tell the truth, I never thought she'd come running here from Laterano."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When Emperor told me she joined Penguin Logistics, I was quite shocked."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But you know, that whole time until Sauin, I never once spoke to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As for what happened then... Just consider it part of the festivities."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's not going to give up looking for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But she's not actually looking for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not like she had anything to do with it, at least not directly, but we all have to keep our mouths shut."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is that something I can clue her in on? Tell me, One-Armed Chainsaw Guy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Please don't unironically call me that name."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Unfortunately, it's absolutely top secret, so you cannot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "See, I can't tell her the thing she wants to know the most, so what's the point of me showing up in her life?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Give her little hints here and there, pique her interest, and drag her into this whole mess?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, you want her to stop caring about you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Isn't that what you want too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As I said, from an official standpoint, I'd like her to distance herself from any matters concerning you. Personally speaking though, I don't really care."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Honestly, if you were to ask me if that's really what I want, I don't think I'd say yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But when I let go of Laterano, cut all my ties, it was just as easy as when I raised my gun that one time. No hesitation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All I can say is, if something happens, just let it be."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That is indeed the kind of person you are, and I don't like it. You don't care about loss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lots of people dislike that about me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But color me interested. What good comes from caring about loss?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You end up crying your eyes out over whatever you've lost and whatever you see yourself losing, and then what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not here to talk philosophy with you. All I'll say is, if you really think that, then why did you come to watch her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Take a guess?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No clue. I don't suppose you're lame enough to be doing this in hopes that she'll realize you're here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You haven't been reading sappy romance novels, have you? Go easy on that stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Grrr!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, did Lemuen ever tell you why El is named after her? Why is her name Lemuel when the two of them are obviously not blood-related?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She keeps her work and her home life separate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "True."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The reason's simple. When she joined that family, El hadn't been born yet, and the parents decided it would be nice to integrate her into the family."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Though, that couple is just as joyous as El. If you told me they were just too lazy to come up with another name, I'd probably buy that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In any case, Lemuen might not straight up say it, but she's really grateful to those parents, deep down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And she cared even more about her little sister Lemuel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So what does that have to do with anything you're doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll spell it out for you, One-Armed Chainsaw Guy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm thinking that Lemuen would let Lemuel leave Laterano, not just because she wanted to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's a discerning one. If El really got obsessed with you-know-what, I don't think she would've let her go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It is precisely because that matter had nothing to do with El, and because finding me is not some obsession she can't give up—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—that she could come to Lungmen and join Penguin Logistics."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What Lemuen really wants is for El to see the world and find her own life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And she kind of indirectly handed the responsibility to look after El over to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even though you left without saying goodbye?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Precisely because I left without saying goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Watching her from a distance probably doesn't count as 'looking after.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not like I left Penguin Logistics because of her either. It's something I should've done from the beginning, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you're doing all this because you believe it's what Lemuen wants you to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who knows."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Might've just been an excuse I came up with to explain why I'm doing this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well that's a surprise. I never expected you to come up with such a sentimental excuse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not a robot. There just happens to be a whole lot of stuff I don't care about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Guilt, nostalgia, sorrow, etcetera etcetera. My heart's packed full of 'em all, but I've got them smoothed out pretty good now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But if you or Lemuen decided to cut ties with me or something, I'd feel pretty sad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For how long?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dunno, I could probably manage a week, yeah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's a damn long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "From ten-thousand feet, you could say I also grew up with those sisters. Since El came here, it's only natural I'd keep an eye out for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, you plan to keep going along like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "More or less? She seems to be getting on just fine with her current partners."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I do think we'll meet once in a pair of blue moons, here or there, but only out of happenstance. That's good enough for you, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's fair..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...is what I'd like to say, though from a personal perspective, I don't think it'd be fair to her, even if I'm not qualified to say it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I guess. But ever since I became the owner of the lock and key, fairness has kind of left my vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If I've got a reason to talk to her, I'm not gonna dodge it. If there is something I have to tell her, I'll deliver the message in person."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the truth is... I don't have a reason, or anything like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have my mission, and this girl already found a new life in this city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't you think that's actually fair, in a sense?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As long as you're fine with the status quo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, shoo already. If someday, by some stroke of ill fortune, she ends up getting tangled in our side's mess, we can pick up this discussion again."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "One-Armed Chainsaw Guy",
      "speakerId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I won't let that happen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here's hoping."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
